{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharpen your sword, strengthen your feet and\u00a0prepare for an unrelenting fight as you play as a samurai who must continue his journey in this fast-paced hack-and-slash survival game. Level up and gain new abilities to increase your chances of survival and\u00a0enhance your combat style to fit your playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty System: Want to test your metal? Try out the different difficulties.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock New Samurai:\u00a0Prove your skill and unlock new characters to choose from and play, each one with their own unique style of fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trinkets: Equip unique trinkets to tweak your ronin's stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Will you fall into despair, or will your blade\u00a0carve a legend?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613790?t=1753387598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613790?t=1753387598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/b5bf724078f77e2d4586a3d27a8c47fdc0a7180b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753387598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/b5bf724078f77e2d4586a3d27a8c47fdc0a7180b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753387598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharpen your sword, strengthen your feet and\u00a0prepare for an unrelenting fight as you play as a samurai who must continue his journey in this fast-paced hack-and-slash survival game. Level up and gain new abilities to increase your chances of survival and\